%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#4F46E5', 'primaryTextColor': '#fff', 'lineColor': '#6366F1'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant UI as 🖥️ UI (React)
    participant API as ⚡ API Route
    participant SVC as 🧠 Service
    participant WF as 🔄 Workflow
    participant ML as 🤖 ML Scorer
    participant DB as 💾 Database

    Note over U,DB: Create Change Request Flow
    
    U->>UI: Fill CR form
    UI->>API: POST /api/v2/changes
    API->>SVC: create(data)
    
    par Parallel Analysis
        SVC->>ML: computeRiskScore()
        ML-->>SVC: mlRiskScore, confidence
    and
        SVC->>SVC: computeImpactScore()
    end
    
    SVC->>DB: Insert ChangeRequest
    SVC->>DB: Insert AuditEvent
    DB-->>SVC: CR created
    SVC-->>API: CR object
    API-->>UI: JSON response
    UI-->>U: Show success

    Note over U,DB: Workflow Transition Flow
    
    U->>UI: Click "Submit"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v2/changes/:n/transitions
    API->>SVC: transition(event)
    SVC->>WF: canTransition(event)?
    WF->>WF: Check guards
    WF-->>SVC: allowed
    SVC->>DB: Update state
    SVC->>DB: Log transition
    DB-->>SVC: Updated
    SVC-->>API: New state
    API-->>UI: Success
    UI-->>U: State updated

    Note over U,DB: Approval Decision Flow
    
    U->>UI: Click "Approve"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v2/changes/:n/approvals/:stepId
    API->>SVC: decideApproval(stepId, decision)
    SVC->>SVC: Check step is active
    SVC->>DB: Update Approval
    SVC->>SVC: Evaluate step policy
    
    alt All steps approved
        SVC->>WF: Auto-transition to approved
        SVC->>DB: Update CR state
    end
    
    SVC->>DB: Log audit event
    SVC-->>API: Updated step
    API-->>UI: Success
    UI-->>U: Decision recorded
